  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Same-species interpretation: lower valve based on the smaller right-hand R.dario specimen in Plate2 Fig1; low flat lid reconstructed from the same paper species description. The photographed specimen does not establish preserved upper valve. No other rudist species combined. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 45, \"width_x\": 25, \"depth_y\": 23}, \"basis\": \"Caption gives base width7cm for the whole Fig1 panel. Smaller right specimen about43-45mm tall and25-28mm wide based on panel scaling. Depth is an inference, not measured; use45x25x23mm working dimensions including thin restored lid.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Partial fossil and oblique photo: rounded estimates, not exact specimen measurement or scan. No claim of missing basal length.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Same-species interpretation: lower valve based on the smaller right-hand R.dario specimen in Plate2 Fig1; low flat lid reconstructed from the same paper species description. The photographed specimen does not establish preserved upper valve. No other rudist species combined. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 45, \"width_x\": 25, \"depth_y\": 23}, \"basis\": \"Caption gives base width7cm for the whole Fig1 panel. Smaller right specimen about43-45mm tall and25-28mm wide based on panel scaling. Depth is an inference, not measured; use45x25x23mm working dimensions including thin restored lid.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Partial fossil and oblique photo: rounded estimates, not exact specimen measurement or scan. No claim of missing basal length.\"}"
